  m_text: "Welcome, Trainee. You are entering an active aviation cargo warehouse
    facility.\n\nYour objective is to inspect 5 operational zones and identify potential
    safety hazards before shift operations commence.\n\n\u2022 Use your controller
    laser to inspect equipment, cargo stacks, and walkways.\n\n\u2022 Point and click
    to flag non-compliant items.\n\n\u2022 Work methodically: you will be evaluated
    on accuracy, detection speed, and safety compliance.\n\n"
